ZO_CreateStringId("SI_WRITCRAFTER_REWARD_ACTIONS_TEXT",        "What to do with each kind of item from a writ reward box. Leave in Bag: nothing. Deposit: moved to your bank the next time you open it. Junk: marked as junk right away. Sell: sold the next time you open a merchant. Keep a Stack, Sell the Rest (repair kits, soul gems): at each merchant, what the boxes gave is sold once you have more than one full stack in your backpack; what you had before is never sold. Extra Crafted Potions, Poisons & Food is what a writ craft makes beyond what the writ needs (skills make several per craft); only that amount is deposited or sold, never the writ's own. Other Containers (e.g. a shipment of ingots) are opened by default. Master writ and survey containers stay closed unless you choose Open; what they hold then follows its own setting. Only what the box gave is moved or sold. Locked, FCO ItemSaver-marked and writ items are never touched; materials that go to the craft bag stay there.")
