ZO_CreateStringId("SI_WRITCRAFTER_HELP",                       "Commands:\n/wc settings - open the settings\n/wc exclusions - choose which materials writs may not use\n/wc stock <item> - how many you have and can use\n/wc price <item> - the price WritCrafter uses\n/wc selftest - check every stack count against the game's own totals\n/wc debug - toggle debug chat messages\n/wc perf - time the work behind bag and bank windows\n/wc checkdata - compare WritCrafter\'s built-in data with the game (run after game updates)\n/wc reagents - the solvents and reagents that make your alchemy daily\n/wc quests - your crafting quests\' tasks, and what WritCrafter reads from master writs\n/wc queue - open the master writ queue (or set a key for it in Controls)\n/wc stations - what the station markers are working from here")
